 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0025/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0025</a>|2026/08/22 07:48| 01 | 340| 014| 0557| 0228| 0334| 1040|    \n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/08/22 07:24| 03 | 270| 014| 0590| 0459| 0335| 1689|    \n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/08/22 03:24| 01 | 070| 022| 0583| 0157| 0291| 0844|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/08/21 12:24| 01 | 294| 010| 0425| 0006| 0422| 0436|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/08/21 12:00| 01 | 036| 006| 0437| 0592| 0198| 1562|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/08/21 11:12| 01 | 288| 026| 029"
